      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AKOYA PEARL (2) has had four runs this campaign without filling a placing. Added to the sequence last time over 2130m at this track, finishing 13 metres away from the winner in eighth but looks likely to get all the favours from this nice draw and in a thin race she can discover winning ways. GET YA BETS ON (6) finished third last start, though well beaten, at Central Wheatbelt over 2130m. Capable of playing a role and is to be respected. FEELING ACES (7) was responsible for a better effort last time out when third over 2100m at Central Wheatbelt. Should run a big race again while LEAVEAMESSAGE (1) is better than his last-start seventh over 2185m at Pinjarra.",
